{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026JoaNeE6LDI1795510787.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>大埔宏福苑大火將近一周年，政務司司長陳國基透露，約50名公務員需接受公務員敘用委員會調查。他指政府不會舉辦悼念活動，亦不會妨礙市民合法悼念。</p><p></p><p>➤<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208109-%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E9%99%B3%E5%9C%8B%E5%9F%BA%E6%96%99%E7%B4%8450%E5%90%8D%E5%85%AC%E5%8B%99%E5%93%A1%E9%9C%80%E5%8F%97%E6%9F%A5%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E7%82%BA%E6%A5%AD%E4%B8%BB%E5%8F%8A%E7%BD%B9%E9%9B%A3%E8%80%85%E5%AE%B6%E5%B1%AC%E5%A2%9E%E5%85%A9%E9%A0%85%E8%A3%9C%E5%8A%A9%E9%87%91\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">宏福苑｜陳國基料約50名公務員需受查　政府為業主及罹難者家屬增兩項補助金</a> </p><p></p><p>尖沙咀寶勒巷前日的致命車禍，涉事私家車男司機被控危險駕駛引致他人死亡等九項罪名，早上在九龍城裁判法院提堂。</p><p></p><p>➤<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208117-%E5%AF%B6%E5%8B%92%E5%B7%B7%E8%BB%8A%E7%A6%8D38%E6%AD%B2%E6%B6%89%E4%BA%8B%E5%8F%B8%E6%A9%9F%E8%A2%AB%E6%8E%A7%E5%8D%B1%E9%9A%AA%E9%A7%95%E9%A7%9B%E7%AD%89%E4%B9%9D%E9%A0%85%E7%BD%AA%E5%90%8D%E7%94%B3%E8%AB%8B%E4%BF%9D%E9%87%8B%E8%A2%AB%E6%8B%92\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">寶勒巷車禍｜38歲涉事司機被控危險駕駛等九項罪名　申請保釋被拒</a> </p><p></p><p>大埔龍尾村蔡天鳳肢解案續審。鄺港智被問及2024年曾寫信要求與警方會面，他稱是想說真相、指證爸爸，擔任特赦證人，但未獲接納。</p><p></p><p>➤<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208083-%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E7%A2%8E%E5%B1%8D%E6%A1%88%E9%84%BA%E6%B8%AF%E6%99%BA%E6%9B%BE%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E4%BB%BB%E7%89%B9%E8%B5%A6%E8%AD%89%E4%BA%BA%E6%8C%87%E8%AD%89%E7%88%B6%E8%A6%AA%E6%9C%AA%E7%8D%B2%E8%AD%A6%E6%96%B9%E6%8E%A5%E7%B4%8D\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳碎屍案｜鄺港智曾要求任特赦證人指證父親　未獲警方接納</a> </p><p></p><p>➤<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208140-%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E7%A2%8E%E5%B1%8D%E6%A1%88%E9%84%BA%E6%B8%AF%E6%99%BA%E7%A8%B1%E6%87%B7%E7%96%91%E5%85%87%E5%99%A8%E5%9C%93%E9%A0%AD%E9%8C%98%E7%94%B1%E5%93%A5%E5%93%A5%E8%B3%BC%E8%B2%B7%E5%BD%A2%E5%AE%B9%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E6%8E%82%E9%83%BD%E7%84%A1%E6%8E%82%E9%81%8E\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳碎屍案｜鄺港智稱懷疑兇器圓頭錘由哥哥購買　形容自己「掂都無掂過」</a></p><p></p><p>海關檢獲約2,300萬元受管制藥物包括治癌藥和減肥針劑，拘捕七人。</p><p></p><p>➤<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208133-%E6%B5%B7%E9%97%9C%E6%AA%A2%E7%B4%84%E5%80%BC2300%E8%90%AC%E5%85%83%E5%8F%97%E7%AE%A1%E5%88%B6%E8%97%A5%E7%89%A9%E6%8B%98%E4%B8%83%E4%BA%BA%E7%95%B6%E4%B8%AD64%E6%94%AF%E6%B8%9B%E8%82%A5%E9%87%9D%E5%8A%91%E5%8C%85%E8%A3%9D%E4%B8%8A%E6%9C%89%E6%97%A5%E6%96%87\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">海關檢約值2300萬元受管制藥物拘七人　當中64支減肥針劑包裝上有日文</a></p><p></p><p>(旁述由AI生成)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T09:44:00.658394+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":412,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T09:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T04:17:12.895209+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T09:37:19.946756+00:00","content_hash":"d3f1b639dbb145826a1eeae3a76828e58bd4e5bf2c69341c6b2da3d90327eea2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T09:44:00.658394+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}